#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:2
msgid "How to configure pull request builds"
msgstr "如何配置 Pull Request 构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this section, you can learn how to configure :doc:`pull request builds "
"</pull-requests>`."
msgstr "本节讲解如何配置 :doc:`Pull Request 构建 </pull-requests>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:6
msgid ""
"Pull request builds are enabled by default on new projects. Your Read the "
"Docs project needs to be connected to a repository from a supported Git "
"provider. See `Limitations`_ for more information."
msgstr ""
"新项目默认启用 Pull Request 构建。你的 Read the Docs 项目需连接到受支持 Git 服务商上的仓库。更多信息见 "
"`Limitations`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:10
msgid "To enable or disable pull request builds:"
msgstr "启用或禁用 Pull Request 构建："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:12
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:60
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Pull request builds`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Pull request builds` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:13
msgid "Enable or disable the :guilabel:`Build pull requests for this project` option"
msgstr "启用或禁用 :guilabel:`Build pull requests for this project` 选项"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:14
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:62
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Update`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Update`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:18
msgid ""
"Pull requests opened before enabling pull request builds will not trigger "
"new builds automatically. Push a new commit to the pull request to trigger "
"its first build."
msgstr ""
"在启用 Pull Request 构建之前打开的 Pull Request 不会自动触发新构建。向该 Pull Request "
"推送新提交即可触发其首次构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:23
msgid ""
"The previous method of pull request previews using a GitHub workflow that "
"called `@readthedocs/actions <https://github.com/readthedocs/actions/>`__ is"
" now deprecated. If you used that method, you should remove its "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"此前使用调用 `@readthedocs/actions <https://github.com/readthedocs/actions/>`__ 的 "
"GitHub 工作流来实现 Pull Request 预览的方式现已弃用。若你使用了该方式，应移除其配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:27
msgid "Build overview"
msgstr "构建概览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:29
msgid ""
"You can enable a build overview comment to be added to your pull requests "
"when changes are detected between the pull request and the latest version of"
" the documentation. This comment includes a list of the files that changed, "
"and links to view the built documentation."
msgstr ""
"你可以启用构建概览评论，当检测到 Pull Request 与文档最新版本之间存在变更时，该评论会自动添加到你的 Pull Request "
"中。评论包含变更文件列表，以及查看已构建文档的链接。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:33
msgid ":ref:`visual-diff:Show build overview in pull requests`"
msgstr ":ref:`visual-diff:Show build overview in pull requests`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:34
msgid "How to configure your project to enable build overviews"
msgstr "如何配置项目以启用构建概览"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:37
msgid "Privacy levels"
msgstr "隐私级别"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:41
msgid "Privacy levels are only supported on :doc:`/commercial/index`."
msgstr "隐私级别仅在 :doc:`/commercial/index` 上受支持。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:43
msgid ""
"If you didn’t import your project manually and your repository is public, "
"the privacy level of pull request previews will be set to *Public*, "
"otherwise it will be set to *Private*. Public pull request previews are "
"available to anyone with the link to the preview, while private previews are"
" only available to users with access to the Read the Docs project."
msgstr ""
"若你未手动导入项目且仓库是公开的，Pull Request 预览的隐私级别将设为*公开* ，否则设为*私有* "
"。公开预览对任何有链接的人可见，私有预览仅对有 Read the Docs 项目访问权限的用户可见。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:51
msgid ""
"If you set the privacy level of pull request previews to *Private*, make "
"sure that only trusted users can open pull requests in your repository."
msgstr "若将 Pull Request 预览的隐私级别设为*私有* ，请确保只有受信任的用户能在你的仓库打开 Pull Request。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:54
msgid ""
"Setting pull request previews to private on a public repository can allow a "
"malicious user to access read-only APIs using the user's session that is "
"reading the pull request preview. Similar to `GHSA-pw32-ffxw-68rh "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"pw32-ffxw-68rh>`__."
msgstr ""
"在公开仓库上将 Pull Request 预览设为私有，可能允许恶意用户利用正在阅读 Pull Request 预览的用户会话访问只读 API。类似 "
"`GHSA-pw32-ffxw-68rh "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/security/advisories/GHSA-"
"pw32-ffxw-68rh>`__ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:58
msgid "To change the privacy level:"
msgstr "更改隐私级别："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:61
msgid "Select your option in :guilabel:`Privacy level of Pull Requests`"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`Privacy level of Pull Requests` 中选择相应选项"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:64
msgid ""
"Privacy levels work the same way as :ref:`normal versions <versions:Version "
"states>`."
msgstr "隐私级别的工作方式与 :ref:`普通版本 <versions:Version states>` 相同。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:67
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:69
msgid ""
"Pull requests are only available for **GitHub** and **GitLab** currently. "
"Bitbucket is not yet supported."
msgstr "Pull Request 目前仅支持 **GitHub** 和 **GitLab** ，尚不支持 Bitbucket。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:70
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, your Read the Docs project needs to be connected to "
"a repository from a supported Git provider."
msgstr "要启用此功能，你的 Read the Docs 项目需连接到受支持 Git 服务商上的仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:71
msgid ""
"If your project is using our :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App`, "
"you don't need to configure a webhook. For GitLab, and projects using our "
"old GitHub integration, you need to make sure that your webhook is "
"configured to send pull request events, not just push events."
msgstr ""
"若项目使用我们的 :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App` ，无需配置 Webhook。对于 GitLab"
" 以及使用旧版 GitHub 集成的项目，需确保 Webhook 配置为发送 Pull Request 事件，而不只是推送事件。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:73
msgid ""
"Builds from pull requests have the same memory and time limitations :doc:`as"
" regular builds </builds>`."
msgstr "Pull Request 构建与常规构建具有相同的内存和时间限制（见 :doc:`/builds` ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:75
msgid "Additional formats like PDF aren't built in order to reduce build time."
msgstr "为缩短构建时间，不构建 PDF 等额外格式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:76
msgid ""
"Read the Docs doesn't index search on pull request builds. This means that "
"Addons search and the Read the Docs Search API will return no results."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 不对 Pull Request 构建建立搜索索引。这意味着 Addon 搜索和 Read the Docs 搜索 API "
"不会返回结果。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:77
msgid ""
"The built documentation is kept for 90 days after the pull request has been "
"closed or merged."
msgstr "Pull Request 关闭或合并后，构建的文档保留 90 天。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:78
msgid ""
"The build overview comment is only available for projects connected to a "
":ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App`."
msgstr "构建概览评论仅对连接了 :ref:`reference/git-integration:GitHub App` 的项目可用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:81
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:83
msgid "No new builds are started when I open a pull request"
msgstr "打开 Pull Request 时没有新构建启动"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:84
msgid ""
"The most common cause when using GitHub is that your Read the Docs project "
"is not :ref:`connected to the corresponding repository on GitHub <reference"
"/git-integration:Connect a repository to an existing project>`."
msgstr ""
"使用 GitHub 时最常见的原因是，你的 Read the Docs 项目未 :ref:`连接到 GitHub 上对应的仓库 <reference"
"/git-integration:Connect a repository to an existing project>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:87
msgid ""
"If you are using our old GitHub integration, make sure that your "
"repository's webhook is configured to send pull request events. You can re-"
"sync your project's webhook integration to reconfigure the Read the Docs "
"webhook."
msgstr ""
"若使用旧版 GitHub 集成，请确保仓库的 Webhook 配置为发送 Pull Request 事件。你可以重新同步项目的 Webhook "
"集成以重配 Read the Docs Webhook。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:92
msgid ""
"To re-sync your project's webhook, go to your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations`, and then select the webhook "
"integration for your provider. Follow the directions to re-sync the webhook,"
" or create a new webhook integration."
msgstr ""
"要重新同步项目的 Webhook，请前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` "
"，然后选择对应服务商的 Webhook 集成。按提示重新同步 Webhook，或创建新的 Webhook 集成。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:96
msgid ""
"You may also notice this behavior if your Read the Docs account is not "
"connected to your Git provider account, or if it needs to be reconnected. "
"You can (re)connect your account by going to :menuselection:`<Username "
"dropdown> --> Settings --> Connected services`."
msgstr ""
"若你的 Read the Docs 账户未连接到 Git 服务商账户，或需要重新连接，也可能出现此现象。可前往 "
":menuselection:`<Username dropdown> --> Settings --> Connected services` "
"（重新）连接账户。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:100
msgid "Build status is not being reported to your Git provider"
msgstr "构建状态未报告到你的 Git 服务商"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:101
msgid ""
"If opening a pull request does start a new build, but the build status is "
"not being updated with your Git provider, then your connected account may "
"have out dated or insufficient permissions."
msgstr "若打开 Pull Request 确实启动了新构建，但构建状态未在 Git 服务商更新，则你的关联账户可能权限已过期或权限不足。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:105
msgid ""
"Make sure that you have granted access to the Read the Docs `GitHub OAuth "
"App`_ for your personal or organization GitHub account."
msgstr "确保你已为个人或组织 GitHub 账户授予 Read the Docs `GitHub OAuth App`_ 访问权限。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:109
msgid ":ref:`guides/setup/git-repo-manual:Debugging webhooks`"
msgstr ":ref:`guides/setup/git-repo-manual:Debugging webhooks`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/pull-requests.rst:110
msgid ":ref:`github-permission-troubleshooting`"
msgstr ":ref:`github-permission-troubleshooting`"

